    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "b4564268410d66ba6831",
      "text": "[3.1 椭圆](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/3.1%20%E6%A4%AD%E5%9C%86--f18eef6d.canvas)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1920
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "2ae1312f4f070c9adcf0",
      "text": "[3.2 双曲线](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/3.2%20%E5%8F%8C%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF--ac85d812.canvas)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1920
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "bdb745358f101968241a",
      "text": "[探究与发现 为什么 $y = \\pm \\frac{b}{a} x$ 是双曲线 $\\frac{x^2}{a^2} - \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$ 的渐近线](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%20%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%20%24y%20%3D%20-pm%20-frac%7Bb%7D%7Ba%7D%20x%24%20%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%8C%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%20%24-frac%7Bx%5E2%7D%7Ba%5E2%7D%20-%20-frac%7By%5E2%7D%7Bb%5E2%7D%20%3D%201%24%20%E7%9A%84%E6%B8%90--164d4c5d.canvas)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1920
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "59f76839388e5f1eb408",
      "text": "[3.3 抛物线](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/3.3%20%E6%8A%9B%E7%89%A9%E7%BA%BF--3a11925d.canvas)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2130
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "d3ac35e3b3a82c78a0ee",
      "text": "[探究与发现 为什么二次函数 $y = ax^2 + bx + c$ 的图象是抛物线](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%20%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20%24y%20%3D%20ax%5E2%20%2B%20bx%20%2B%20c%24%20%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%9B%E7%89%A9%E7%BA%BF--dcb67386.canvas)",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 500,
      "y": 2130
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "ed4e8136e3b3776b60c6",
      "text": "[阅读与思考 圆锥曲线的光学性质及其应用](../../%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82/%E4%BA%BA%E6%95%99A-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E6%80%A7%E5%BF%85%E4%BF%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%86%8C/%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83%20%E5%9C%86%E9%94%A5%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%85%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%80%A7%E8%B4%A8%E5%8F%8A%E5%85%B6%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8--b80b85c5.canvas)",
